{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S02、S04、S13等段的感受词组仍然偏密，交替排布也不如Y左右分栏容易连续扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮关键词能让人迅速抓住每段心理变化的核心，而且音乐感受不只是泛泛描述情绪，还细分了声音、力度、声部、运动感和情绪转折，并通过水波、小船等意象形成前后呼应。Y的叙事因果更顺畅，左右分栏也更方便扫读，但部分心理变化和音乐中的细微转折被概括掉了，少了一些逐步变化的体验。综合而言，X虽然更费一点注意力，但听音乐时能获得的细节和情绪层次更多。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa20532d-85e8-4505-a852-90b119230794", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000741705692Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:09:03.725919+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "48b1c78922ab44ed27852ed31249152dd2c0e28aeba2de5175f568a666b879e9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":